# White Plume Adventurer: "At the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, untap a creature you control." Its controller's only creature is the
# Adventurer itself; with the trigger on the stack at Bot2's turn-4 upkeep, Bot2 kills it with a Lightning Bolt, and the trigger resolves with
# no creature to untap and asks nothing (! Bot1.Choose). Bot1 casts the Adventurer on turn 1 off three Moxen (taking the initiative); at its turn-3 upkeep the initiative ventures into the Lost Well
# rather than the Forge, whose counters would save the Adventurer from the Bolt.

